{
 "0447fa356eb5": {
  "file": "0447fa356eb5.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 4.08,
  "bytes": 24717,
  "text": "That part isn't true. Here's the true sentence. Try it once more."
 },
 "125ae952c647": {
  "file": "125ae952c647.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 4.13,
  "bytes": 25005,
  "text": "Only the county decides. Leave out the promise and try it once more."
 },
 "61fb304aa75c": {
  "file": "61fb304aa75c.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 5.76,
  "bytes": 34797,
  "text": "Welcome! Today you'll gather signatures to put the Neighborhood Libraries Act on the ballot."
 },
 "85dac67e8850": {
  "file": "85dac67e8850.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.65,
  "bytes": 22125,
  "text": "About 25% get thrown out. Let's learn which ones count."
 },
 "bcb02eb8c08f": {
  "file": "bcb02eb8c08f.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.24,
  "bytes": 19677,
  "text": "The county checks each signer's voter record for four things."
 },
 "bddfbdee8456": {
  "file": "bddfbdee8456.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 2.66,
  "bytes": 16221,
  "text": "1. Is this person registered to vote?"
 },
 "6ec2bc9c6b3d": {
  "file": "6ec2bc9c6b3d.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 2.71,
  "bytes": 16509,
  "text": "2. Are they registered in this county?"
 },
 "b1a2144d60c0": {
  "file": "b1a2144d60c0.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.07,
  "bytes": 18669,
  "text": "3. Are they registered at the address they wrote?"
 },
 "5eae70937173": {
  "file": "5eae70937173.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.12,
  "bytes": 18957,
  "text": "4. Does the signature look like theirs?"
 },
 "3d1a34ed7efb": {
  "file": "3d1a34ed7efb.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 10.51,
  "bytes": 63309,
  "text": "With four yeses, the signature counts. With one no, it's thrown out. Only the county decides, so never promise anyone their signature will count."
 },
 "26478221cfea": {
  "file": "26478221cfea.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 5.95,
  "bytes": 35949,
  "text": "Let's play the county. Five people signed at Westside Market today. Decide which lines count."
 },
 "b91fb3bb7235": {
  "file": "b91fb3bb7235.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 7.66,
  "bytes": 46173,
  "text": "Three of those five lines get thrown out. Not one was about handwriting. All three were about who signed."
 },
 "295c94a4ea88": {
  "file": "295c94a4ea88.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 5.59,
  "bytes": 33789,
  "text": "Luis signed twice. The county checks a sample, about 3 lines in every 100."
 },
 "d5549edb4d60": {
  "file": "d5549edb4d60.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 6.79,
  "bytes": 40989,
  "text": "The drive loses about 1,000. One double in the sample tells the county the stack holds many more."
 },
 "658ae81967e3": {
  "file": "658ae81967e3.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 10.99,
  "bytes": 66189,
  "text": "Nate had the better hour. Signatures that count are the score. Libraries for All checks your signatures. Your bonus is paid on the ones that count."
 },
 "2edff595a282": {
  "file": "2edff595a282.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 8.98,
  "bytes": 54093,
  "text": "One question screens out the most bad lines. Here comes a woman in scrubs. Go ahead and ask her if she's registered to vote in L.A. County."
 },
 "da35d4e5d01b": {
  "file": "da35d4e5d01b.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.87,
  "bytes": 11469,
  "text": "I am. Why do you ask?"
 },
 "442d634bcf27": {
  "file": "442d634bcf27.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 3.46,
  "bytes": 20973,
  "text": "Me? I vote in every election. Why do you ask?"
 },
 "a4ab9b3b1e7f": {
  "file": "a4ab9b3b1e7f.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 2.3,
  "bytes": 14061,
  "text": "Oh, the library? What do you need?"
 },
 "e62911dbe97c": {
  "file": "e62911dbe97c.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 3.79,
  "bytes": 22989,
  "text": "Makes sense. I vote every time, so sure, I'll sign."
 },
 "1b2aeaac7cec": {
  "file": "1b2aeaac7cec.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.82,
  "bytes": 11181,
  "text": "Oh, okay. Well, good luck!"
 },
 "510173be7081": {
  "file": "510173be7081.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 0.58,
  "bytes": 3693,
  "text": "Hi."
 },
 "61bd533eeec5": {
  "file": "61bd533eeec5.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.25,
  "bytes": 7725,
  "text": "I'm good, thanks."
 },
 "d2ad4f1464db": {
  "file": "d2ad4f1464db.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.18,
  "bytes": 7293,
  "text": "I'll think about it."
 },
 "1fbbc18e0d34": {
  "file": "1fbbc18e0d34.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.39,
  "bytes": 8589,
  "text": "Okay, bye now."
 },
 "a69eced3a5ea": {
  "file": "a69eced3a5ea.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 2.04,
  "bytes": 12477,
  "text": "Sorry, I've got to run. Good luck!"
 },
 "7ed424a0c0d0": {
  "file": "7ed424a0c0d0.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.46,
  "bytes": 9021,
  "text": "Thanks! Good luck out here."
 },
 "53748c67ee9a": {
  "file": "53748c67ee9a.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 4.06,
  "bytes": 24573,
  "text": "Now watch a trained canvasser do the whole job, start to finish."
 },
 "319abf0fb13d": {
  "file": "319abf0fb13d.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 7.9,
  "bytes": 47613,
  "text": "Hi there! I'm collecting signatures for a ballot measure to keep libraries open later. Are you registered to vote in L.A. County?",
  "take": 1
 },
 "5622a9f80317": {
  "file": "5622a9f80317.mp3",
  "who": "ines",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 0.74,
  "bytes": 4701,
  "text": "I am."
 },
 "a66fde5314b6": {
  "file": "a66fde5314b6.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 13.54,
  "bytes": 81453,
  "text": "I'm paid to gather signatures, and here are this month's top funders. It funds longer evening and weekend hours at branch libraries, paid for by a new state tax on digital ad sales. Have you signed this one already?"
 },
 "8d3797994f61": {
  "file": "8d3797994f61.mp3",
  "who": "ines",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 0.62,
  "bytes": 3981,
  "text": "No."
 },
 "50235bdb22e1": {
  "file": "50235bdb22e1.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 3.91,
  "bytes": 23709,
  "text": "Then here's the petition. Will you sign to put it on the ballot?"
 },
 "135143f6fc20": {
  "file": "135143f6fc20.mp3",
  "who": "ines",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 0.6,
  "bytes": 3837,
  "text": "Sure."
 },
 "4a5b080d005c": {
  "file": "4a5b080d005c.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 4.82,
  "bytes": 29181,
  "text": "Print your name, sign, then write the address where you're registered to vote."
 },
 "328f56a25fe7": {
  "file": "328f56a25fe7.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 1.37,
  "bytes": 8445,
  "text": "All set. Thank you!"
 },
 "da6e406fab6d": {
  "file": "da6e406fab6d.mp3",
  "who": "ines",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 1.61,
  "bytes": 9885,
  "text": "Thanks! Good luck out here."
 },
 "491da7c9afee": {
  "file": "491da7c9afee.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.26,
  "bytes": 19821,
  "text": "Two of her lines are the law. Say each one once."
 },
 "461f84736714": {
  "file": "461f84736714.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 2.38,
  "bytes": 14493,
  "text": "Good. Take those two lines with you today."
 },
 "6ccba014e7b4": {
  "file": "6ccba014e7b4.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 6.12,
  "bytes": 36957,
  "text": "Let's try one. Here comes a man with a coffee. Say hi as he walks up, and see if he'll stop."
 },
 "04dd1fec6281": {
  "file": "04dd1fec6281.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.27,
  "bytes": 7869,
  "text": "Yeah, I'm registered."
 },
 "b9a2229667bb": {
  "file": "b9a2229667bb.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.06,
  "bytes": 6573,
  "text": "Sure, I'll sign."
 },
 "ed2273d05188": {
  "file": "ed2273d05188.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 2.21,
  "bytes": 13485,
  "text": "Oh, the library? What do you need?"
 },
 "b12668162eca": {
  "file": "b12668162eca.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 2.02,
  "bytes": 12333,
  "text": "Oh, sorry, I'm busy. Have a good day.",
  "take": 1
 },
 "cbd250982573": {
  "file": "cbd250982573.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.27,
  "bytes": 7869,
  "text": "Sorry, I don't have a minute."
 },
 "3e2828f6c31d": {
  "file": "3e2828f6c31d.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.18,
  "bytes": 7293,
  "text": "Sorry, what's this?"
 },
 "735718422134": {
  "file": "735718422134.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 0.53,
  "bytes": 3405,
  "text": "Hi."
 },
 "a83fb96f06c9": {
  "file": "a83fb96f06c9.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.18,
  "bytes": 7293,
  "text": "I'm good, thanks."
 },
 "4ff9625115c0": {
  "file": "4ff9625115c0.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.01,
  "bytes": 6285,
  "text": "I'll think about it."
 },
 "fd3b7f857ea9": {
  "file": "fd3b7f857ea9.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 0.94,
  "bytes": 5853,
  "text": "Okay, bye now."
 },
 "cd2f7088d394": {
  "file": "cd2f7088d394.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 2.06,
  "bytes": 12621,
  "text": "Sorry, I've got to run. Good luck!",
  "take": 1
 },
 "252dc6f4f069": {
  "file": "252dc6f4f069.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.37,
  "bytes": 8445,
  "text": "Thanks! Good luck out here."
 },
 "2d6dd9753fb5": {
  "file": "2d6dd9753fb5.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.72,
  "bytes": 22557,
  "text": "Now listen to a trained canvasser. She does this all day."
 },
 "e4d10906c2c4": {
  "file": "e4d10906c2c4.mp3",
  "who": "tanya",
  "voice": "el:XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX:0.88",
  "dur": 2.23,
  "bytes": 13629,
  "text": "I am, yeah. Sure, I'll sign."
 },
 "49037e875ada": {
  "file": "49037e875ada.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 1.49,
  "bytes": 9165,
  "text": "First, she said hi."
 },
 "5529fcfd87a9": {
  "file": "5529fcfd87a9.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 5.5,
  "bytes": 33213,
  "text": "Second, she said she's collecting signatures, and what for, in one short sentence."
 },
 "0dd30c708446": {
  "file": "0dd30c708446.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 7.82,
  "bytes": 47181,
  "text": "Third, she asked if the woman is registered to vote in L.A. County. A yes means the woman can sign, and now they're talking."
 },
 "9f02d43beafb": {
  "file": "9f02d43beafb.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 4.99,
  "bytes": 30189,
  "text": "Fourth, she never asked for a minute. The whole thing took about five seconds."
 },
 "7c9ffe1b779b": {
  "file": "7c9ffe1b779b.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 2.93,
  "bytes": 17805,
  "text": "Here's one more. This time, the man isn't registered."
 },
 "642006920aa9": {
  "file": "642006920aa9.mp3",
  "who": "dwayne",
  "voice": "el:nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb:0.88",
  "dur": 0.82,
  "bytes": 5133,
  "text": "No, I'm not."
 },
 "0d3eabf555ba": {
  "file": "0d3eabf555ba.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 1.63,
  "bytes": 10029,
  "text": "No problem. Have a good one!",
  "take": 1
 },
 "69a606ba056f": {
  "file": "69a606ba056f.mp3",
  "who": "dwayne",
  "voice": "el:nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb:0.88",
  "dur": 0.79,
  "bytes": 4989,
  "text": "You too!"
 },
 "b8536707a7b1": {
  "file": "b8536707a7b1.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 6.34,
  "bytes": 38253,
  "text": "He can't sign, so she lets him go and turns to the next person. His no just saved her a minute."
 },
 "e393ad8c1c7c": {
  "file": "e393ad8c1c7c.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 8.04,
  "bytes": 48477,
  "text": "B is right. Passersby stop for someone who is standing, looking at them and ready. The table is just where your things sit."
 },
 "65964b661c29": {
  "file": "65964b661c29.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 7.82,
  "bytes": 47181,
  "text": "B is right. Stand where passersby walk, and never block the way. Anyone who wants to keep walking can."
 },
 "8785c624747a": {
  "file": "8785c624747a.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 4.37,
  "bytes": 26445,
  "text": "Here's a new canvasser. Listen for the one thing that goes wrong."
 },
 "17e0b2ddc6cb": {
  "file": "17e0b2ddc6cb.mp3",
  "who": "rico",
  "voice": "el:bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o:0.88",
  "dur": 8.93,
  "bytes": 53805,
  "text": "Hi! Do you have a minute? I'm collecting signatures for a ballot measure to keep libraries open later. Are you registered to vote in L.A. County?",
  "take": 3
 },
 "42e1c48a595a": {
  "file": "42e1c48a595a.mp3",
  "who": "hank",
  "voice": "el:pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4:0.88",
  "dur": 1.7,
  "bytes": 10461,
  "text": "Sorry, I don't have a minute.",
  "take": 2
 },
 "096732815041": {
  "file": "096732815041.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 12.05,
  "bytes": 72525,
  "text": "About 5% to 10% stop, even for the best canvassers. That's one or two passersby in every 20. A no isn't about you, and someone else is always coming."
 },
 "6b35ba30276c": {
  "file": "6b35ba30276c.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 8.88,
  "bytes": 53517,
  "text": "Your turn again. Three passersby are coming, one after another. Say your opener to each one as they walk up. Your best one counts."
 },
 "e0564a2bf123": {
  "file": "e0564a2bf123.mp3",
  "who": "soojin",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 1.13,
  "bytes": 7005,
  "text": "Yes, I am."
 },
 "11adfc85bc99": {
