  "dur": 4.7,
  "bytes": 28461,
  "text": "Now listen to a trained canvasser. An older man heard her opener and stopped."
 },
 "b1356db407c5": {
  "file": "b1356db407c5.mp3",
  "who": "bob",
  "voice": "el:CwhRBWXzGAHq8TQ4Fs17:0.88",
  "dur": 2.21,
  "bytes": 13485,
  "text": "I'm registered. What've you got?"
 },
 "ee450dd94e0d": {
  "file": "ee450dd94e0d.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 4.99,
  "bytes": 30189,
  "text": "Thanks for stopping. I'm paid to gather signatures, and here are this month's top funders."
 },
 "246d0d47a8cf": {
  "file": "246d0d47a8cf.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 9.62,
  "bytes": 57981,
  "text": "It funds longer evening and weekend hours at branch libraries, and it's paid for by a new state tax on digital ad sales. Have you signed this one already?"
 },
 "4403593beb8c": {
  "file": "4403593beb8c.mp3",
  "who": "bob",
  "voice": "el:CwhRBWXzGAHq8TQ4Fs17:0.88",
  "dur": 1.46,
  "bytes": 9021,
  "text": "No, first I've heard of it."
 },
 "e95cc21b98f9": {
  "file": "e95cc21b98f9.mp3",
  "who": "bob",
  "voice": "el:CwhRBWXzGAHq8TQ4Fs17:0.88",
  "dur": 1.54,
  "bytes": 9453,
  "text": "All right. Where do I sign?"
 },
 "4b8908581486": {
  "file": "4b8908581486.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 9.77,
  "bytes": 58845,
  "text": "First, she said she's paid and showed the top funders before the petition left her hand. The law requires both, even if nobody asks."
 },
 "a53fa3002e0a": {
  "file": "a53fa3002e0a.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.72,
  "bytes": 22557,
  "text": "Second, she said what the measure does and how it's paid for."
 },
 "cbc54bb19ff7": {
  "file": "cbc54bb19ff7.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 6.05,
  "bytes": 36525,
  "text": "Third, she asked if he signed already, because one double can cost about 1,000 signatures."
 },
 "1fe768754586": {
  "file": "1fe768754586.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 6.86,
  "bytes": 41421,
  "text": "Fourth, she asked for the signature and left the choice with him, because people sign when they're asked."
 },
 "f473b84db28e": {
  "file": "f473b84db28e.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 7.32,
  "bytes": 44157,
  "text": "C is right. Nothing in the measure says libraries are closing, and nobody can promise what a tax will cost."
 },
 "75d33bb8bfa1": {
  "file": "75d33bb8bfa1.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.5,
  "bytes": 21261,
  "text": "B is right. A sheet is only good for the month printed on it."
 },
 "b6b9f73bd477": {
  "file": "b6b9f73bd477.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 5.18,
  "bytes": 31341,
  "text": "A is right. A second signature never helps, and it can cost the drive about 1,000."
 },
 "3e552caf7778": {
  "file": "3e552caf7778.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.46,
  "bytes": 20973,
  "text": "Here's the new canvasser again. One part is missing.",
  "take": 1
 },
